---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
const updated = 'June 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Mama Bloom handles your data — short version: your personal pregnancy data stays on your device. We don’t collect or sell it."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="note">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <div class="callout">
        <p class="note" style="margin:0">
          <b>The short version:</b> the dates and details you enter stay in your browser on your
          device. We don’t have a server that collects them, and we don’t sell your data — ever.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Information you enter</h2>
      <p>
        Calculators on {site.name} (due date, ovulation, hCG, weight gain, contraction timer) run
        entirely in your browser. Any values you type are processed on your device. Where we save
        something for your convenience — such as your due date or contraction history — it’s stored
        in your browser’s local storage and never transmitted to us.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to keep {site.name} privacy-friendly. If we use analytics, we choose tools that are
        cookie-light and do not build advertising profiles of you. We do not run third-party
        advertising trackers.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        The core experience does not require cookies. Your browser may store small amounts of data
        (like your saved due date) in local storage, which you can clear at any time from your
        browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        We load fonts from Google Fonts and host the site on Cloudflare’s network, which may process
        limited technical request data (such as IP addresses) to deliver and secure the site, as
        described in their own policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is intended for adults and is not directed at children under 13.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by the “last
        updated” date above.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy? Reach out and we’ll be glad to help.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
